        "created_at": "2015-01-11T04:03:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Question that came up in a WotC game that we are playing...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thorathian Military hits everything for 2 and Idealist (who has Chaos Lord title) gets hit first. &nbsp;Good Hero Bad Hero is played with a +1 attack. &nbsp;We target Thorathiam Military and kill it. &nbsp;Should the remaining targets not have taken damage because the Thorathian Military was destroyed? &nbsp; Or since the damage went first, are the other targets safe from damage?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:17.729Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
